OL,3,GNEWSAPart of A30 closed due to vehicle
OL,4,Afire smoke
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a main road has been closed due
OL,7,Fto "large amounts of smoke" from a
OL,8,Fvehicle fire, a council has said.
OL,10,FCornwall Council confirmed both
OL,11,Fcarriageways of the A30 had been closed
OL,12,Fnear Pennygillam, Launceston. The
OL,13,Feastbound carriageway has since
OL,14,Freopened, police said.
OL,16,FStudents have been sent home from
OL,17,FLaunceston College, and staff said the
OL,18,Fsmoke travelled to "approximately two
OL,19,Fthirds of the school site".
OL,21,FThe council urged people nearby to keep
OL,22,Fwindows and doors closed.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
